    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just being \"lost.\" i'm actually empty. there's no spark, no drive, nothing. it's like the engine has completely failed and i'm just idling in the dark. it feels more like a permanent state than a phase. like the version of me that actually mattered is just... dead. i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
