      "content": "it just feels so exhausting. pretending to be a person, pretending i'm still \"in there\" when i know i'm not. there's no recovery from this. why keep trying to fix a machine that’s clearly just scrap metal now? it feels like there's no point in waiting for a version of me that’s never coming back.",
